  "id": "compassionate-love",
  "term": "compassionate love",
  "definition": "Compassionate love is an awareness and understanding of suffering that involves feeling connected to another’s distress and being moved, emotionally and mentally, to help relieve it. In this packet, it is described especially as compassion directed toward vulnerable strangers or people in need.",
